  "name": "AtendimentoNavegacaoMangara",
  "title": "atendimento-navegacao-Mangara",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "Registro do atendimento de navegação do cuidado pelo profissional navegador: contato realizado (Communication), encerramento ou próximo retorno (Appointment). Mostra nome e telefone do profissional da ponta.",
  "language": "pt-BR",
  "meta": {
    "profile": [
      "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire"
    ]
  },
  "subjectType": [
    "Patient"
  ],
  "date": "2026-11-18",
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-launchContext",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "name",
          "valueCoding": {
            "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/CodeSystem/launchContext",
            "code": "patient"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "type",
          "valueCode": "Patient"
        },
        {
          "url": "description",
          "valueString": "Paciente da navegação"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-launchContext",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "name",
          "valueCoding": {
            "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/CodeSystem/launchContext",
            "code": "user"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "type",
          "valueCode": "Practitioner"
        },
        {
          "url": "description",
          "valueString": "Profissional navegador logado"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-launchContext",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "name",
          "valueCoding": {
            "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/CodeSystem/launchContext",
            "code": "encounter"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "type",
          "valueCode": "Encounter"
        },
        {
          "url": "description",
          "valueString": "Encounter da teleinterconsulta que originou a navegação (Task.encounter)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "refPonta",
        "language": "text/fhirpath",
        "expression": "%encounter.participant.where(type.coding.where(system = 'https://terminologia.saude.gov.br/fhir/CodeSystem/BRResponsabilidadeParticipante' and code = 'solicitante').exists()).individual.reference.first()"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/variable",
      "valueExpression": {
        "name": "ponta",
        "language": "application/x-fhir-query",
        "expression": "{{%refPonta}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
      "valueMarkdown": "UCNAV03/04/06. Preenchido pelo profissional navegador owner da Task de navegação (Task.code = tipo NavegacaoHSL). QuestionnaireResponse: subject = Patient; basedOn = ServiceRequest da navegação (code HSL_Servicos#NAVEGACAO); author = PractitionerRole do profissional navegador; authored = agora. Ao salvar, o Mangará grava num único Bundle transaction: QuestionnaireResponse, Communication, RelatedPerson novo (se houver), Appointment (se retorno), atualização da Task (status/businessStatus/note) e, no encerramento, do ServiceRequest e dos retornos futuros. Na primeira ação, Task.status accepted → in-progress."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "linkId": "PONTA",
      "text": "Profissional solicitante da teleinterconsulta/ teleconsultoria",
      "type": "group",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "Somente leitura, para o profissional navegador ligar. Profissional da ponta = Encounter.participant da teleinterconsulta com type = solicitante (VS https://mangara.hsl.org.br/fhir/ValueSet/TipoParticipante; código 'solicitante' do CS BRResponsabilidadeParticipante, do MS). É o profissional que participou da teleIC (pode ser diferente de quem pediu – ver /profissional-solicitante). Não confundir com o solicitante da navegação, que é o teleconsultor do HSL (ServiceRequest.requester)."
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "nomeProfissionalPonta",
          "text": "Nome do Profissional Solicitante",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%ponta.name.first().select(iif(text.exists(), text, given.join(' ') & ' ' & family))"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "telefoneProfissionalPonta",
          "text": "Celular / telefone",
          "type": "string",
          "readOnly": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "%ponta.telecom.where(system = 'phone').value.first()"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "CONTATO",
      "text": "Contato de navegação",
      "type": "group",
      "required": true,
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
          "valueMarkdown": "Gera 1 Communication (UCNAV03): status, statusReason, medium (sem category), subject = Patient, sent, recipient, sender = PractitionerRole do profissional navegador logado, basedOn = ServiceRequest da navegação, partOf = Task da navegação, payload[0].contentString = anotacao, payload[1].contentReference = este QuestionnaireResponse."
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "dataHoraContato",
          "text": "Data e hora do contato",
          "type": "dateTime",
          "required": true,
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression",
              "valueExpression": {
                "language": "text/fhirpath",
                "expression": "now()"
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-constraint",
              "extension": [
                {
                  "url": "key",
                  "valueId": "nav-1"
                },
                {
                  "url": "severity",
                  "valueCode": "error"
                },
                {
                  "url": "expression",
                  "valueString": "%resource.repeat(item).where(linkId='dataHoraContato').answer.value.all($this <= now())"
                },
                {
                  "url": "human",
                  "valueString": "A data e hora do contato não pode ser futura."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "→ Communication.sent. Padrão = agora."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "comQuemFalou",
          "text": "Com quem falou",
          "type": "choice",
          "required": true,
          "answerValueSet": "https://mangara.hsl.org.br/fhir/ValueSet/DestinatarioNavegacao",
          "extension": [
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl",
              "valueCodeableConcept": {
                "coding": [
                  {
                    "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control",
                    "code": "radio-button"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/designNote",
              "valueMarkdown": "Define Communication.recipient. VS e CS DestinatarioNavegacao criados no OCL (v1.0.0). Códigos propostos (→ recurso): paciente (Patient, automático); familiar-cuidador (RelatedPerson); profissional-ponta – profissional da ponta / solicitante da teleinterconsulta (Practitioner do Encounter da teleIC, automático); teleconsultor-hsl – teleconsultor que pediu a navegação (ServiceRequest.requester, automático); equipe-aps – equipe da APS / EMSI / ACS (PractitionerRole); servico-referencia – especialidade, hospital, CAPS (Organization); regulacao (Organization); rede-protecao – CRAS, CREAS, Conselho Tutelar (Organization); vigilancia (Organization); assistencia-farmaceutica (Organization); casai-dsei (Organization); outro (só texto)."
            }
          ]
        },
